 **DEV-009**: Negative—agreed accessibility arrangement (live captions, confirmed in writing) explicitly refused on interview day, causing communication failure. Candidate requested new interview with captions and awaits response. This is a qualifying serious concern and open follow-up.\\n- **DEV-010**: Positive—favorable evaluation with specific concrete examples (clear explanations of hours/pay, responsiveness to questions). Testimonial-worthy.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVcArWMs1qoDhueHxFhH\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3322,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVcAr6K5AJDmfTfbeVfK\",\"session_id\":\"4e4943f7-1b07-4932-b037-0695954951f6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T09:33:54.548Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"7e49feeb-272f-47d8-92f3-c3659b9e8f00\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"},\"id\":\"toolu_012DmnehQB3qGtxgLzrgi4h6\",\"input\":{\"records\":[{\"follow_up_needed\":\"no\",\"id\":\"DEV-001\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"yes\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"no\",\"id\":\"DEV-002\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-003\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"no\",\"id\":\"DEV-004\",\"sentiment\":\"neutral\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_